OL,3,GNEWSAHow bluetongue virus exploded in
OL,4,Athe South West
OL,5,
OL,6,FA virus which can be deadly to
OL,7,Flivestock successfully overwintered in
OL,8,Fparts of the UK before spreading
OL,9,Frapidly, scientists believe.
OL,11,FCases of the bluetongue virus, which
OL,12,Faffects sheep and cattle as well as
OL,13,Fother animals, continue to spread with
OL,14,Fthe latest government figures showing
OL,15,Fconfirmed cases on 684 farms across
OL,16,FEngland, Wales and Scotland since the
OL,17,Foutbreak began in July.
OL,19,FDevon and Cornwall - which has almost
OL,20,Ftwo thirds of confirmed cases - is the
OL,21,Fepicentre of the outbreak.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
