OL,3,GNEWSAHow bluetongue virus exploded in
OL,4,Athe South West
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Simon Gubbins, an epidemiologist at
OL,7,Fthe Pirbright Institute, which is
OL,8,Ftesting for the virus, said the UK had
OL,9,F"never seen anything like the South
OL,10,FWest cluster" but the strain was likely
OL,11,Fnot reintroduced from Europe.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
